  "b3": "Your brain releases endorphins, your body's feel-good chemicals.",
  "b4": "Over time, laughing often can ease stress and lift your mood.",
  "b5": "Laughing with friends can even help you handle pain better.",
  "end": "Who makes you laugh the most?"
